                            <Polygon POINTS="2286 731 2265 729 2243 729 2221 729 2200 729 1994 729 1992 729 1990 729 1966 740 1567 729 1565 729 1563 729 1531 740 1455 727 1453 727 1362 738 1344 727 1342 727 1340 727 1338 727 1336 727 1308 738 1295 727 1292 727 1290 727 1288 727 1286 727 1238 738 1180 727 1178 727 1175 727 1149 738 1123 727 1121 727 1119 727 1117 727 1093 738 1071 727 1069 727 1067 727 1065 727 1039 738 643 736 643 770 641 783 2412 790 2416 775 2416 742 2308 731 2286 731"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="he makes an attack in broad daylight and in the presence of several herdsmen,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l4" HPOS="645" VPOS="785" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="645 835 2421 827" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 835 645 850 2419 842 2421 827 2416 798 2341 785 2338 785 2278 796 2263 785 2260 785 2258 785 2256 785 2254 785 2252 785 2232 798 2107 798 2083 785 2081 785 2079 785 2016 796 1994 785 1992 785 1990 785 1988 785 1985 785 1968 798 1665 788 1663 788 1661 788 1626 798 1572 788 1570 788 1567 788 1526 801 1184 790 1182 790 1071 803 894 792 892 792 775 803 731 792 729 792 727 792 654 803 645 835"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="as I myself had occasion to witness. Possibly this may be due to the fact"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l5" HPOS="645" VPOS="853" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="645 894 2419 887" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 894 645 911 2416 904 2419 887 2414 857 664 853 662 853 660 853 658 853 645 894"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="that the Chukchee have a taboo against the use of fire-arms on the wolf, and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l6" HPOS="643" VPOS="909" WIDTH="1033" HEIGHT="69" BASELINE="645 948 1676 954" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 948 643 965 656 974 658 974 660 974 662 974 955 965 1331 978 1334 978 1674 967 1676 954 1676 926 1652 913 1650 913 1648 913 1645 913 1606 924 1550 913 1463 913 1461 913 1459 913 1457 913 1457 915 1446 924 1407 913 1405 913 1403 913 1401 913 1368 924 1279 913 1277 913 1052 922 1035 911 1033 911 1030 911 1028 911 1026 911 987 922 913 909 911 909 909 909 870 922 740 922 729 911 729 909 727 909 725 909 723 909 656 917 645 948"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="will use only a lasso or a trap for killing it."/>
                    </TextLine>
