                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="THE HERDSMAN’S WORK. — On the open, stormy tundra the Chukchee"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l8" HPOS="641" VPOS="1028" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="643 1073 2419 1069" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1073 643 1088 2416 1084 2419 1069 2416 1039 2397 1028 2395 1028 2393 1028 2390 1028 2334 1039 2226 1028 2224 1028 2137 1039 2109 1028 2107 1028 2105 1028 2102 1028 2076 1041 1864 1041 1845 1028 1842 1028 1840 1028 1691 1028 1689 1028 1687 1028 1684 1028 1667 1041 1526 1041 1461 1030 1459 1030 1457 1030 1427 1041 1355 1030 1353 1030 1351 1030 1323 1041 1308 1030 1305 1030 1303 1030 1301 1030 1236 1041 1030 1030 1028 1030 1026 1030 991 1041 955 1030 952 1030 950 1030 894 1041 749 1030 747 1030 641 1039 643 1073"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="herdsman, who has no watch-dog, has a considerable amount of trouble with"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l9" HPOS="641" VPOS="1084" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="643 1134 2419 1127" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1134 643 1149 2416 1143 2419 1127 2414 1097 2304 1084 2302 1084 2204 1095 2189 1084 2187 1084 2185 1084 2182 1084 2089 1095 2066 1084 2063 1084 2061 1084 1981 1095 1955 1084 1953 1084 1951 1084 1949 1084 1916 1095 1814 1086 1812 1086 1810 1086 1808 1086 1795 1097 1775 1086 1773 1086 1771 1086 1717 1097 1615 1086 1613 1086 1611 1086 1609 1086 1589 1099 1383 1099 1297 1086 1295 1086 1232 1099 1178 1088 1175 1088 991 1099 963 1088 961 1088 959 1088 957 1088 955 1088 942 1099 929 1088 926 1088 924 1088 747 1088 744 1088 742 1088 712 1099 654 1088 651 1088 649 1088 647 1088 647 1091 641 1095 643 1134"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="his half-wild herd. The reindeer are only half domesticated, and ready to"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l10" HPOS="641" VPOS="1149" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="643 1195 2416 1190" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1195 643 1208 2412 1210 2416 1190 2412 1160 1541 1149 1539 1149 1537 1149 1535 1149 1522 1160 662 1151 660 1151 658 1151 656 1151 641 1158 643 1195"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="disperse on the first occasion. When left to themselves in the open tundra,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l11" HPOS="641" VPOS="1212" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="643 1255 2419 1251" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1255 643 1273 2416 1273 2419 1251 2414 1221 667 1212 664 1212 662 1212 641 1221 643 1255"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="they soon become quite wild, and even more wary than the wild reindeer,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l12" HPOS="641" VPOS="1268" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="72" BASELINE="643 1316 2416 1309" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1316 643 1329 872 1340 874 1340 877 1340 879 1340 894 1329 1162 1329 1230 1340 1232 1340 1234 1340 1275 1327 1615 1337 1617 1337 1619 1337 1661 1327 2414 1327 2416 1309 2412 1281 2059 1268 2057 1268 1983 1279 1905 1268 1903 1268 1901 1268 1899 1268 1881 1279 1853 1268 1851 1268 1849 1268 1784 1281 1323 1270 1321 1270 1318 1270 1295 1281 913 1273 911 1273 909 1273 907 1273 892 1283 799 1273 796 1273 794 1273 757 1283 669 1273 667 1273 664 1273 641 1283 643 1316"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="since they know the ways of man. Every now and then, when going to a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l13" HPOS="641" VPOS="1333" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="643 1376 2419 1370" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1376 643 1389 2416 1383 2419 1370 2414 1340 658 1333 656 1333 654 1333 651 1333 641 1340 643 1376"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="fresh pasture or wandering over the tundra, some wayward animals will start"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l14" HPOS="645" VPOS="1392" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="645 1435 2416 1428" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1435 645 1450 2412 1452 2416 1428 2412 1398 660 1392 658 1392 645 1435"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="in the wrong direction, and the herdsman has to head them off. The herd,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l15" HPOS="645" VPOS="1448" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="645 1496 2421 1489" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1496 645 1511 2419 1504 2421 1489 2416 1459 1827 1448 1825 1448 1823 1448 1821 1448 1821 1450 1810 1459 1245 1450 1243 1450 1240 1450 1238 1450 1225 1461 669 1452 667 1452 664 1452 656 1454 645 1496"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="therefore, progresses but slowly; and the more slowly, the larger the number"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l16" HPOS="645" VPOS="1506" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="645 1554 2421 1547" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1554 645 1569 2419 1563 2421 1547 2416 1519 2265 1519 2250 1506 2247 1506 2245 1506 2243 1506 2241 1506 2204 1517 1983 1506 1981 1506 1979 1506 1955 1519 1806 1519 1771 1509 1769 1509 1767 1509 1765 1509 1736 1519 1609 1509 1606 1509 1557 1519 1526 1509 1524 1509 1522 1509 1453 1519 1396 1509 1394 1509 1392 1509 1362 1519 1308 1509 1305 1509 1232 1521 684 1511 682 1511 680 1511 656 1517 645 1554"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of animals. The highest praise for a herdsman is to say that his herd moves"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l17" HPOS="645" VPOS="1571" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="645 1612 2421 1608" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1612 645 1628 1511 1636 1513 1636 1615 1625 1697 1636 1700 1636 1795 1625 1905 1636 1907 1636 1910 1636 1912 1636 1927 1625 2016 1625 2169 1636 2172 1636 2174 1636 2198 1625 2260 1636 2263 1636 2265 1636 2289 1625 2373 1636 2375 1636 2377 1636 2421 1623 2421 1608 2416 1576 673 1571 671 1571 669 1571 656 1576 645 1612"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="along swiftly; like “the small cluster of a poor man,” to employ the usual"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l18" HPOS="645" VPOS="1643" WIDTH="693" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="645 1671 1338 1671" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1671 645 1688 1338 1688 1338 1671 1338 1643 654 1643 645 1671"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="expression of the heroic tales."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_1-110_r4" HPOS="642" VPOS="1697" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="1432" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="642 1697 2420 1697 2420 3129 642 3129"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l19" HPOS="749" VPOS="1688" WIDTH="1674" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="751 1734 2423 1729" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="751 1734 751 1749 2421 1744 2423 1729 2419 1699 1598 1688 1596 1688 1593 1688 1565 1701 749 1701 751 1734"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="During certain seasons, especially with the coming of insects, the herd"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l20" HPOS="643" VPOS="1757" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="643 1792 2421 1792" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1792 643 1807 2421 1807 2421 1792 2419 1757 643 1760 643 1792"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="requires the utmost exertion of everybody in the camp, including girls and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l21" HPOS="641" VPOS="1812" WIDTH="1780" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="643 1853 2421 1846" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1853 643 1868 2419 1861 2421 1846 2416 1818 751 1812 749 1812 641 1822 643 1853"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="married women. The latter, though not very active, are able to relieve the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l22" HPOS="641" VPOS="1870" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="643 1911 2419 1907" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 1911 643 1929 2416 1924 2419 1907 2414 1874 775 1870 773 1870 641 1881 643 1911"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="men for a little while, so as to give them their much-needed rest. The herd"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l23" HPOS="645" VPOS="1937" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="645 1974 2421 1965" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 1974 645 1996 2419 1980 2421 1965 2414 1937 654 1944 645 1974"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="will not stay on the same spot, even for a short time, but wants to move"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l24" HPOS="641" VPOS="1987" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="643 2032 2419 2028" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 2032 643 2048 2416 2043 2419 2028 2416 2000 2382 1987 2380 1987 2377 1987 2375 1987 2343 1998 2256 1987 2254 1987 2185 1998 2048 1987 2046 1987 1990 1998 1953 1987 1951 1987 1949 1987 1806 1998 1684 1987 1682 1987 1680 1987 1678 1987 1663 1998 1589 1989 1587 1989 1515 2000 1494 1989 1492 1989 1489 1989 1487 1989 1459 2000 957 1989 955 1989 900 2000 844 1989 842 1989 770 2000 734 1989 731 1989 729 1989 641 2002 643 2032"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="against the wind to find relief from insects. When stopping for a while, only"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l25" HPOS="641" VPOS="2045" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="643 2095 2419 2087" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="643 2095 643 2110 2416 2106 2419 2087 2414 2054 2159 2045 2156 2045 1944 2058 1914 2048 1912 2048 1910 2048 1907 2048 1879 2058 1838 2048 1836 2048 1834 2048 1832 2048 1806 2061 1628 2061 1541 2048 1539 2048 1537 2048 1535 2048 1520 2061 1386 2050 1383 2050 1312 2061 1277 2050 1275 2050 1273 2050 1175 2061 1141 2050 1139 2050 1136 2050 1037 2063 827 2052 825 2052 725 2063 662 2052 660 2052 658 2052 656 2052 641 2061 643 2095"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the centre of the herd stands quietly. The outer animals move swiftly around"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l26" HPOS="645" VPOS="2108" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="69" BASELINE="645 2154 2416 2147" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2154 645 2167 900 2167 955 2177 957 2177 1020 2167 2414 2167 2416 2147 2412 2119 1825 2108 1823 2108 1821 2108 1819 2108 1801 2119 1240 2110 1238 2110 1236 2110 1234 2110 1221 2121 658 2113 645 2154"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="it — now from left to right, then from right to left — as if performing a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l27" HPOS="645" VPOS="2169" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="645 2214 2421 2210" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2214 645 2229 2419 2225 2421 2210 2416 2180 1533 2169 1531 2169 1528 2169 1492 2180 664 2171 662 2171 660 2171 658 2171 645 2214"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="dance, and then suddenly dash forward against the breeze, carrying along the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l28" HPOS="645" VPOS="2225" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="645 2275 2416 2266" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2275 645 2290 2414 2286 2416 2266 2412 2238 2250 2238 2234 2225 2232 2225 2230 2225 2228 2225 2226 2225 2198 2236 2098 2225 2096 2225 1953 2238 1927 2227 1925 2227 1923 2227 1769 2238 1743 2227 1741 2227 1739 2227 1736 2227 1708 2238 1643 2227 1641 2227 1524 2240 686 2232 684 2232 682 2232 656 2240 645 2275"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="whole herd. When the herdsmen are too few for regular watches, they may"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l29" HPOS="645" VPOS="2292" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="645 2336 2419 2327" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2336 645 2351 2416 2342 2419 2327 2414 2299 1089 2292 1087 2292 1084 2292 1056 2303 710 2294 708 2294 654 2303 645 2336"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="not get time to sleep for two or three days in succession, and often are so"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l30" HPOS="645" VPOS="2346" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="70" BASELINE="645 2394 2416 2387" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2394 645 2409 1823 2416 1825 2416 1827 2416 1862 2405 2414 2405 2416 2387 2414 2359 2369 2346 2367 2346 2364 2346 1992 2357 1955 2346 1953 2346 1951 2346 1823 2359 1780 2349 1777 2349 1775 2349 1773 2349 1741 2359 1587 2349 1585 2349 1515 2359 1485 2349 1483 2349 1481 2349 1314 2359 1262 2349 1260 2349 1258 2349 1230 2362 669 2351 667 2351 664 2351 662 2351 658 2351 645 2394"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="tired that they drop to the ground and fall asleep against their will. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l31" HPOS="645" VPOS="2409" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="645 2452 2421 2448" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2452 645 2468 2419 2463 2421 2448 2416 2420 1572 2409 1570 2409 1567 2409 1526 2420 760 2411 757 2411 654 2422 645 2452"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="worst weather is a heavy warm fog without wind, because then the insects"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l32" HPOS="645" VPOS="2470" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="645 2513 2419 2507" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2513 645 2530 2416 2524 2419 2507 2414 2478 1236 2470 1234 2470 1232 2470 1195 2481 840 2472 838 2472 654 2483 645 2513"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="are most troublesome, and the herdsmen cannot watch the movements of the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l33" HPOS="645" VPOS="2541" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="645 2572 2419 2572" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2572 645 2589 2419 2589 2419 2572 2419 2541 656 2541 645 2572"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="distant animals. At such times a herd may easily be lost, if the herdsman"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-110_l34" HPOS="645" VPOS="2587" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="645 2630 2419 2626" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="645 2630 645 2645 2416 2641 2419 2626 2414 2600 2306 2587 2304 2587 2302 2587 2278 2598 1708 2587 1706 2587 1704 2587 1674 2598 1615 2587 1613 2587 1502 2600 671 2589 669 2589 667 2589 656 2593 645 2630"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="should fall asleep even for a moment. To find its tracks in summer is no"/>
